": "1830449300822153", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982610_1830449304155486_9105627070072408848_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0FTVoKSX2yAQ7kNvwHR9O99&_nc_oc=AdkRLzLFPFZLdStg0VUVCScENd3xnTusboRZziTWFNxkxPAx20t1prmQjX_aCWr_zBo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv5wQQDYWeLFPX6eUskM579BwwV2GagRfY4_xGnFTGU0Q&oe=699D89CA"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-13.png", "id": "9449026898446045", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974691_9449026905112711_4579666727095828995_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O8RSLivuVpkQ7kNvwFCfJ9o&_nc_oc=Adk5N44tSDDIB1iO5FtysWvVUGWGGAQBWfRnZDgi1KR6U3KVqH2HUl5QWbUhahxoKC4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv7aiN8dT-v3j9vS4bGsSxakgRZOs5DnMtcA5j61WiJcQ&oe=699D9A04"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-11.png", "id": "1969264830167481", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974803_1969264833500814_717700601129842921_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rgdiwfgbN1cQ7kNvwEFyoT3&_nc_oc=AdkYM3onFeAVWOHKcR_vQAphhZzA2DhzBb1SEU2H5BLBQqsCEw_PhSEjVOfelLjfwjM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvI9DrU_L_Rq4_Tuya43e80uwPtOyktlAQRb2LqibX-Xg&oe=699D9FDE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer-Cover-Image-MINI.png", "id": "1128857345307826", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43997708_1128857348641159_7151441411599407678_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gHoCuhDP610Q7kNvwGyTeRc&_nc_oc=Adl4DP-GI3SRIskqfm_sOrC-Z6WMJrMo6DUJT6JlXBw6mGlG2V82uaXwvlB3XHiWBdQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvhgxYNhNi9DFN5ZPKAy9PtrAz-aZeoBnqRjB7tGhziJA&oe=699D8A8C"}, "display_name": "Squingle Mini", "keywords": ["puzzle", "MR", "puzzling", "demo", "squingle"], "long_description": "# \ud83c\udf00 Buy Squingle Mini for only $0.99 and save $2 on the full game when you upgrade!\n\nSquingle Mini, offers an incredible bite-sized experience of the unique Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game, Squingle. \n\nEmbark on a journey where the lines between the virtual and real worlds blur, offering endless fun and mind-bending challenges.\n\nGuide the orbs from start to finish, avoid the edges, and collect points as you navigate through glass-like mazes called \u2018Squingles.\u2019\ud83c\udf20\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf08 A VISUAL MASTERPIECE\nEach maze is a stunning, morphing, glass-like sculpture that comes to life in either Mixed Reality or a fully immersive environment, offering an unmatched visual experience in the puzzle genre.\n\n\n# \ud83e\udde9 ACCESSIBILITY\nDesigned to be accessible for a wide range of players and skill levels, with intuitive controls and hand-tracking support for seamless play, whether standing or seated.\n\n\n# \ud83d\ude0c GLOBAL LEADERBOARD\nCompete on the Squingle Mini Leaderboard! See the sum of your best times across all levels and compare them with others around the globe.\n\n \n# \ud83d\udc7b RACE YOUR GHOST\nChallenge your best times on each level to improve your leaderboard rank for endless fun!\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf00 Immerse yourself in the world of Squingle, where every twist presents a new challenge! \ud83c\udf20", "short_description": "\ud83c\udf00 Buy Squingle Mini for only $0.99 and save $2 on the full game when you upgrade!\n\nSquingle Mini, offers an incredible bite-sized experience of the unique Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game, Squingle. \n\nEmbark on a journey where the lines between the virtual and real worlds blur, offering endless fun and mind-bending challenges.\n\nGuide the orbs from start to finish, avoid the edges, and collect points as you navigate through glass-like mazes called \u2018Squingles.\u2019\ud83c\udf20"}]}, "developer_name": "Dr. Benjamin Outram ", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://squingle.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VRAL Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://squingle.com